bluejetty:00156601:ios.description:
We’re not just an app… we’re a pharmacy. CaryRx is a digital pharmacy that provides convenient same and next day prescription delivery. Stop wasting time in the pharmacy line and switch to CaryRx today.
// Free to use
CaryRx is free of charge to use, just pay your copay. A better pharmacy experience for the same price as your local pharmacy.
// Easy to add prescriptions
You can easily move your prescriptions from your current pharmacy to CaryRx or have your doctor send prescriptions directly to CaryRx.
// Free delivery
Schedule delivery for a specific time and day or have it brought to you as soon as possible via express delivery.
// The future of pharmacy
CaryRx’s pharmacy platform is fully integrated to make sure prescriptions are quickly processed in our pharmacy when received from your doctor.
// CaryRx pharmacists available for you
All of our pharmacists are PharmD’s and are available to answer your questions when needed. Chat with our pharmacy team quickly and easily.
// Features
-Order tracker
-Delivery tracking
-Chat with the pharmacy team in-app
-Order paper prescriptions
-Easy prescription management
-Order for your family from your account
// For Health Plans
Patient monitoring through Apple Health integration allowing patients to share metrics with their care team. See Terms and Conditions for details.

